   "id": 0,
   "en": "{07 15 00}Tee hee{01 00 00 05 00}.{01 00 00 05 00}.{01 00 00 05 00}.{01 00 00 0f 00} Too late,\n{04 1f 00}! {01 00 00 05 00}{0b 03 00}{04 02 00}!\nYes, it's sad but true!\nI beat you to \n{07 00 00}{0b 01 00}{04 1a 00}\nages ago!\nI'm not usually a gloater,\nbut {07 03 00}{01 00 00 05 00}I WON! I WON! I WON!{01 00 00 0f 00}\nI never win, {01 00 00 05 00}{04 02 00}!\n{07 03 00}Mwa ha ha ha!{01 01 00} Ya ha ha ha!{01 01 00}\nHeh heh heh heh heh heh!{01 01 00}\n{07 11 00}Aha {01 00 00 05 00}aha {01 00 00 05 00}aha {01 00 00 05 00}a{01 00 00 05 00}.{01 00 00 05 00}.{01 00 00 05 00}.\n{07 01 00}{01 08 00}{01 02 00}ACHOO!!! {01 03 00}{01 00 00 1e 00}{07 07 00}Ooh, darn it! {01 00 00 05 00}Stupid\nallergies messing up my\nvictory chuckle!",
   "et": "{07 15 00}Hii hii{01 00 00 05 00}.{01 00 00 05 00}.{01 00 00 05 00}.{01 00 00 0f 00} Liiga hilja,\n{04 1f 00}! {01 00 00 05 00}{0b 03 00}{04 02 00}!\nJah, kurb, aga tõsi!\nJõudsin sinust ette\n{07 00 00}{0b 01 00}{04 1a 00}\nasjus ammu!\nMa tavaliselt ei kiitle,\naga {07 03 00}{01 00 00 05 00}MA VÕITSIN! VÕITSIN!{01 00 00 0f 00}\nMa ei võida iial, {01 00 00 05 00}{04 02 00}!\n{07 03 00}Muah hah haa!{01 01 00} Ja hah haa!{01 01 00}\nHeh heh heh heh heh heh!{01 01 00}\n{07 11 00}Ahaa {01 00 00 05 00}ahaa {01 00 00 05 00}ahaa {01 00 00 05 00}a{01 00 00 05 00}.{01 00 00 05 00}.{01 00 00 05 00}.\n{07 01 00}{01 08 00}{01 02 00}APTŠII!!! {01 03 00}{01 00 00 1e 00}{07 07 00}Oi, pagan! {01 00 00 05 00}Rumal\nallergia rikub mu\nvõidunaeru ära!"
  },
  {
   "id": 1,
   "en": "{07 16 00}Hey now, {01 00 00 05 00}{04 1f 00},{01 00 00 0f 00} you're\nway too late, {01 00 00 05 00}{04 02 00}!\nYou snooze, you lose!\nI got the\n{07 14 00}{0b 02 00}{04 1a 00}{01 00 00 05 00}\nages ago! {01 00 00 05 00}{0b 03 00}{04 02 00}!\n{07 0d 00}I guess you didn't know, {01 00 00 05 00}but\nI'm always the best at\nwhatever I do!",
   "et": "{07 16 00}Kuule, {01 00 00 05 00}{04 1f 00},{01 00 00 0f 00} sa oled\nliiga hilja, {01 00 00 05 00}{04 02 00}!\nKes magab, see kaotab!\nMa sain\n{07 14 00}{0b 02 00}{04 1a 00}{01 00 00 05 00}\nammu! {01 00 00 05 00}{0b 03 00}{04 02 00}!\n{07 0d 00}Vist sa ei teadnud, {01 00 00 05 00}aga\nma olen alati parim selles,\nmida ma teen!"
  },
  {
   "id": 2,
   "en": "{07 04 00}Whoa{01 00 00 05 00}.{01 00 00 05 00}.{01 00 00 05 00}.{01 00 00 0f 00} {07 15 00}That wasn't easy!\nBut I already got the {07 00 00}\n{0b 02 00}{04 1a 00}{01 00 00 05 00}!\n{07 14 00}So, I guess this means{01 00 00 05 00}.{01 00 00 05 00}.{01 00 00 05 00}.{01 00 00 05 00} I\nwon the game, {01 00 00 05 00}{04 02 00}!\nYip-yip-yippee!\n{07 00 00}I hate to fuss about\nwho won and who lost.\n\n{07 0a 00}But beating you{01 00 00 05 00} is really\nmaking me happy,\n{01 00 00 05 00}{04 02 00}!",
   "et": "{07 04 00}Ohoo{01 00 00 05 00}.{01 00 00 05 00}.{01 00 00 05 00}.{01 00 00 0f 00} {07 15 00}See polnud kerge!\nAga ma sain juba {07 00 00}\n{0b 02 00}{04 1a 00}{01 00 00 05 00}!\n{07 14 00}Nii et see tähendab{01 00 00 05 00}.{01 00 00 05 00}.{01 00 00 05 00}.{01 00 00 05 00} et\nvõitsin mängu, {01 00 00 05 00}{04 02 00}!\nJipp-jipp-jipii!\n{07 00 00}Ma ei taha kiruda selle\nüle, kes võitis või kaotas.\n\n{07 0a 00}Aga sinu võitmine{01 00 00 05 00} teeb\nmind tõesti õnnelikuks,\n{01 00 00 05 00}{04 02 00}!"
